        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Oliver Boot, Molière\n- Works: Antony and Cleopatra, In Extremis, Three Musketeers, Hayfever, Tartuffe, Jamaica Inn, Othello\n- Organizations: Cheek by Jowl\n- Roles: Abelard\n\nFacts:\n- Tartuffe, or The Impostor or The Hypocrite, is a theatrical comedy by Molière that was first performed in 1664.\n- Oliver Boot’s theatre credits include Antony and Cleopatra, Three Musketeers, Hayfever, Tartuffe, and Jamaica Inn.\n- Oliver Boot appeared in In Extremis in the role of Abelard.\n- Oliver Boot took part in an award-winning world tour of Othello with Cheek by Jowl.",
